<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12738" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκᾰλέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>recall,</i> esp. from exile, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>call away</i> or <i>aside,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.3.35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>call by a name,</i> esp. by way of disparagement,
				<i>stigmatize as . .,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν τοῦ μανέντος . . ξύναιμον
					ἀποκαλοῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					727
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλιγαρχικοὺς καὶ μισοδήμους ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					4.16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἐν ὀνείδει ἀ. μηχανοποιόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					512c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργόν, σοφιστὴν ἀ. τινά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.2.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.6.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὓς νῦν ὑβρίζει καὶ πτωχοὺς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.211
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἐν αἰσχρῷ φιλαύτους ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1168a30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράσιτον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Timocl.
					19
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαριεντισμὸν ἀ.</span>
			<i>call</i> it a <i>sorry</i> jest, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				168d
			</span></i>; sts. without any bad sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς χαλεπαίνοντας ἀνδρώδεις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1109b18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				10.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.776e
			</span></i>.</div>
